    "text_full": "﻿﻿\nmenu close menu\nHome\nSkin Care\nWaxing / Tinting / Bleaching\nMakeup\nHair Care\nEthnic Hair Care\nNails\nMen’s Services\nMassage\nPackages\nSpecials\nProducts\n \n \n \n \n \n1\n2\n3\n4\n5\nPrevious\nNext\nWelcome to Alta Villa Spa & Salon\nAlta Villa Spa & Salon is a full service facility dedicated to providing quality services and products in a comforting atmosphere.\nAt Alta Villa Spa & Salon, we know that you deserve a truly special spa experience – so our Sophisticated Pampering™ commitment means that we will do everything we can to provide luxurious and relaxing services that leave you looking and feeling great.\nOur carefully trained, courteous, and friendly staff members are here to provide superior skin care, nail care, massage therapy, and hair styling services you want and need.\nYOU are our priority every time you visit Alta Villa Spa & Salon, whether you’re trying us for the first time or coming back because you’ve earned another trip.\nContact Us today to arrange for your Sophisticated Pampering™ experience!\n\nSearch\nSearch for:  \nHours of Operation*\n\nMonday & Thursday:          9 a.m. - 7 p.m.\nTuesday & Wednesday:    9 a.m. - 4:30 p.m.\nFriday & Saturday:               9 a.m. - 5 p.m.\n\n \n\n*Hours subject to change without notice.\n\n \n\nContact Information\n\nAlta Villa Spa & Salon\n425 Forbes Avenue, Suite 505\nPittsburgh, PA 15219\n\nPhone: 412-281-2566\n\n          \n\nCopyright 2015 | Alta Villa Spa & Salon\nContact Us\nEmployee Biographies\nSalon Policies\nGift Card Policy\nEmployment Opportunities"
